{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家發改委表示，「十五五」時期將新建約一萬五千公里鐵路，基本實現鐵路的現代化目標；亦會加快建設上海國際航運中心，優化提升長三角、粵港澳大灣區港口群。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發改委又表示，「十五五」期間將新建約15個民用運輸機場，行業安全水平、服務能力、基礎設施要邁向國際一流。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.821086+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:49.112516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:47.621444+00:00","content_hash":"f73f914d7aa6b3023ecec1cb73331a07e418a65e396e4cb511bcd2bc303f9949","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}